## Building a Dice Roller

### Rolling One Die

```xiom
fn roll_die(sides: Int, seed: &mut Int) -> Int {
  seed = (seed * 1103515245 + 12345) % 2147483648;
  (seed % sides) + 1
}
```

### Rolling Multiple Dice (e.g., 3d6 = three 6-sided dice)

```xiom
fn roll_dice(count: Int, sides: Int, seed: &mut Int) -> Vec[Int] {
  let mut results: Vec[Int] = Vec[Int].new();
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < count {
    results.push(roll_die(sides, seed));
    i += 1;
  };
  results
}

fn roll_sum(count: Int, sides: Int, seed: &mut Int) -> Int {
  let mut total = 0;
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < count {
    total += roll_die(sides, seed);
    i += 1;
  };
  total
}
```

