### RPG Stat Generation

In D&D, stats are generated by rolling 4d6 and dropping the lowest:

```xiom
fn roll_stat(seed: &mut Int) -> Int {
  let mut rolls: Vec[Int] = Vec[Int].new();
  rolls.push(roll_die(6, seed));
  rolls.push(roll_die(6, seed));
  rolls.push(roll_die(6, seed));
  rolls.push(roll_die(6, seed));

  let min_idx = find_min_index(&rolls);
  rolls.remove(min_idx);

  rolls.get(0).unwrap() + rolls.get(1).unwrap() + rolls.get(2).unwrap()
}
```

